            "⊢: Initialize quantum register to void state".to_string(),
            "⊙: Critical self-modeling gate at PINCH (IMSCRIB = ⊙, horn torus R=r)".to_string(),
            "⋈: Compose horn torus winding circuit (CLINK, d=12, 16 sectors)".to_string(),
